The files in this directory are derived from NIST OSCAL content:

    https://github.com/usnistgov/oscal-content
    NIST Special Publication 800-53 Revision 5 (control catalog)
    NIST Special Publication 800-53B (control baselines)

These are works of the United States Government. Pursuant to 17 U.S.C. 105,
they are not subject to copyright protection in the United States and are in
the public domain.

The transformation applied here (OSCAL JSON to per-family JSONL, resolution of
organisation-defined parameter placeholders into readable labels) is mechanical
and is performed by scripts/rebuild_catalogs.py. Control identifiers, titles,
statements, and guidance text are reproduced without alteration of meaning.

NIST does not endorse this project. Use of NIST publications does not imply
any approval, certification, or affiliation. Do not represent output derived
from these files as NIST-validated.
